  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-STORM-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "No, I did not see Balaur and his rising influence. That was before my sister gave to me the Eye of History. I was still focused on creating the Spiral.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_AH-STORM_050.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1779136,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-STORM-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I did of course see him found his Scholomance, but as I have said, the least harmful option was to wait for you to arrive and deal with him.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_AH-STORM_051.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1779136,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-STORM-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Darkmoor will improve, Wizard, its monster population will wane. The battle will be hard-fought, but the Outsiders will become Outsiders no more.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_AH-STORM_052.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1779136,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-STORM-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I know it is difficult to wait and watch, even knowing the story has a happy end. But sometimes, despite all our power, that is the best we can do.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_AH-STORM_053.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1779136,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-STORM-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Ack, ye bossy banshee, it's all ye do, order us around like ye're the queen of the Arcanum. Wait and watch and let others do the work.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dwarf_Porfessor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Ignus_Ferric_AH-STORM_046.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1779132,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-STORM-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Vigilance is a value it seems Athanor long forgot, but the Nimbari never did. Even at my young age, I was told to be mindful, disciplined and ready...",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Ione_Virga_AH-STORM_058.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1765150,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-STORM-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Ready for the Cabal to infiltrate your whole society, to be ushered away by a pig in a wig? You ain't a leader, Ione, ain't Raven's chosen.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dwarf_Porfessor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Ignus_Ferric_AH-STORM_047.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1779132,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-STORM-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You're a wee little waif cast out on the winds.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dwarf_Porfessor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Ignus_Ferric_AH-STORM_048.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1779132,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-STORM-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You malformed, misbegotten homunculus, I am Nimbari. I am the storm. I am the fury and the focus and the ferocity of Raven herself!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Ione_Virga_AH-STORM_059.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1765150,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-STORM-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Another path opens to you. This, I think, you will find more direct than before. No cantrips will be required. But do mind the gap.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_AH-STORM_054.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1779136,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
